<title>USA: Merrimack College, Mass., repriced, ylds 5.336 pct.</title>
<headline>Merrimack College, Mass., repriced, ylds 5.336 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it repriced Merrimack College, Mass., $30 million bond deal, at the repricing the top yield was 5.336 percent in 2027.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>MASSACHUSETTS INDUSTRIAL FINANCE AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $30,495,000*</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, MERRIMACK COLLEGE ISSUE,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>We have received the verbal award.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA	MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 07/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
